.SH NAME
lean-meta - View or set profile metadata


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean meta [profile] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show or update metadata for a profile (description, author, tags).

.PP
Examples:
  lean meta production
  lean meta production --description "Main production API" --author DominionDev --tags aws,production
  lean meta                          # active profile


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--author\fP=""
	Author name

.PP
\fB--description\fP=""
	Profile description

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for meta

.PP
\fB--tags\fP=""
	Comma-separated tags


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlean(1)\fP


